z1QVsJmmk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT_Y7Bhnz3RQxRl1vKENCp-mkI_w-RAfKT7ey_6PCKLNg&oe=6AFC72C6"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "198477324768984", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162743_108416083180856_5143234439450460160_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pQ64K_zXB3wQ7kNvwGOSvzy&_nc_oc=Adr7q2p7wrlb1i37yvK7XsIdUM20OuFD1MnnqsU3VucvPYtAMXoraEM3lOFxu3ZihSI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS00ccXerbBee8QhJEuLQZ1IDd14cdeG63hOZcNWMR6CQ&oe=6AFC7AC3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ultrawings", "keywords": ["Ultrawings", "Simulation", "Ultralight", "Adventure", "Flying"], "long_description": "In Ultrawings, you'll pilot multiple aircraft to complete tons of missions while soaring around beautiful islands.\n\nFully supports 3DOF controller for a truly unparalleled flight experience!  \n\nKey Features:\n\n- Pilot 4 distinct aircraft each with their own handling characteristics!\n\n- Soar around 4 unique, beautifully-stylized islands!\n\n- Earn money to buy new airports and new vehicles! Ultrawings is a VR game with REAL progression!\n\n- Lots gameplay variety! Pop balloons, race, perform spot landings, fly through score rings, and even perform emergency landings! Ultrawings is the ultimate hobbyist flight game!\n\n- Full English VO support guides you through the game!", "short_description": "Take to the skies in the Ultralight, rocket-powered Glider, Sport Plane, and Gee Racer to complete a variety of missions across an island-themed world!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://bitplanetgames.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://bitplanetgames.com/", "publisher_name": "Bit Planet Games, LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://ultrawingsgame.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_ta